    "intro_html":  "The Olive Garden favorite, rebuilt at home: golden chicken strips, bell peppers, and red onion over spaghetti in a garlic butter sauce. Each bowl carries \u003cstrong\u003e60 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e at 871 calories for about \u003cstrong\u003e$4.27\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). The restaurant version is mostly butter and pasta anyway, and those are two of the cheapest things you can buy.",
